// : the committed target-profile files' semanticProfile blocks are pinned to
// the C++ BUILTIN (single source of truth) and the PUBLISHED semantic-profile
// contract version — so a rigid lowering's default (no-profile) capability and
// the file it ships cannot drift, and a downstream author can discover the
// contract version from --version-json.
//
// RUN: python3 %S/check_semantic_profile_drift.py %neutrino-gen %examples
